OL,2,V55555555CLIBYAN SANCTIONS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CBACK ON, SAY ALLIES
OL,5, The US, France and Britain have renewed
OL,6, their push for sanctions against Libya
OL,7, after Tripoli reversed a promise to
OL,8, hand over two Lockerbie bomb suspects.
OL,10, Libya said earlier it would not give up
OL,11, the two alleged agents until the
OL,12, International Court of Justice had
OL,13, ruled on the issue.
OL,15, The three Western allies are calling
OL,16, for an arms embargo on Libya, cutting
OL,17, off air traffic and diplomatic
OL,18, expulsions.
OL,20, A UN resolution is already drafted and
OL,21, the allies are conferring on strategy.
OL,23,F]DFrom 25-03-92 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
