OL,2,V55555555C60,000 ENGINEER JOBS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTO GO - BOSSES
OL,4,B
OL,5, Britain's beleaguered engineering
OL,6, industry can expect a gradual recovery
OL,7, this year, but not before another
OL,8, 60,000 jobs are axed, the employers say
OL,10, A report from the Engineering Employers
OL,11, Federation says the industry has
OL,12, weathered the worst of the slump and
OL,13, forecasts a recovery in new car sales.
OL,15, But it warns 60,000 more jobs will go
OL,16, this year, adding to the 165,000 lost
OL,17, in two years and bringing the number
OL,18, working in engineering to below 1.8m.
OL,20, The report says the UK engineering
OL,21, market will grow by 8% in 15 months.
OL,23,F]DFrom 25-03-92 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
