OL,2,V55555555CRUSHDIE CALL FOR
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CPRESSURE ON IRAN
OL,5, Author Salmon Rushdie called for
OL,6, pressure against Iran to lift its death
OL,7, sentence against him when he met
OL,8, members of the Senate in Washington.
OL,10, He told them there was no reason to
OL,11, "soft pedal" his campaign now that
OL,12, Western hostages had been released.
OL,14, Meanwhile, British Muslims have
OL,15, attacked a move to publish a paperback
OL,16, version of the Satanic Verses.
OL,18, Copies of the book, which brought the
OL,19, death sentence from Ayatollah Khomeini
OL,20, for "blaspheming" the Prophet Mohammad,
OL,21, are expected in shops within weeks.
OL,23,F]DFrom 25-03-92 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
