OL,2,V55555555CTWO-YEAR PATIENT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CWAITING LIST HALVED
OL,5, The number of patients waiting more
OL,6, than two years for an NHS operation has
OL,7, almost halved over a month, according
OL,8, to Department of Health figures.
OL,10, In February 11,208 patients had been
OL,11, waiting for treatment for over two
OL,12, years, compared with a 20,494 total in
OL,13, January.
OL,15, Health Secretary William Waldegrave
OL,16, announced earlier this year he wanted
OL,17, all health authority two-year patient
OL,18, waiting lists cleared by April 1.
OL,20, The move is a key element in the
OL,21, Government's health reforms.
OL,23,F]DFrom 25-03-92 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
