OL,2,V55555555CCRESSON PROMISES
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CCABINET RESHUFFLE
OL,5, French Prime Minister Edith Cresson
OL,6, said her cabinet would be reshuffled
OL,7, following the rout of her Socialist
OL,8, Party in regional elections.
OL,10, Her own popularity has fallen to record
OL,11, lows and pundits say there is strong
OL,12, pressure on President Mitterrand to
OL,13, drop her or make swingeing changes.
OL,15, Press speculation on a replacement has
OL,16, focused on Culture Minister Jack Lang
OL,17, and EC President Jacques Delors.
OL,19, The Socialists won just over 18% of the
OL,20, vote against 33% to the conservative
OL,21, opposition.
OL,23,F]DFrom 25-03-92 / teletextarchive.com
